patch "PerkTemplate" "perk.buff" {
    set "Description" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" """
            Two-a-days. Bear crawls. Suicides and shuttles. Momentary urges to die harden one against death itself.


            <style="Highlight">• +$1 <link="hitpoints">HP</link> per <link="squaddies">Dummy</link>.
            • Removes "encumbered" effect from heavy armor and weapons. </style>
            """
    }
    set "ShortDescription" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" "+$1 HP per Dummy and removes \"encumbered\" effect."
    }
}

patch "PerkTemplate" "perk.first_aid" {
    set "Description" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" """
            TCR Health Care: Slapping a bandaid on a Marine so he can slap a bullet into an enemy.


            <style="Highlight">• ACTIVATE: Heal a wounded Element and sets the target units morale to neutral. Can heal allied SL's.
            • PASSIVE: Increases the chance to rescue dummies in ALL units by $1% with a minimum of $2.</style>
            """
    }
    set "ShortDescription" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" "ACTIVATE: Heal an element to full HP. PASSIVE: Increase global Dummy Rescue Chance by $1%."
    }
}

patch "PerkTemplate" "perk.gostepriimstvo_babushki" {
    set "Description" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" """
            “Yaz is remarkably resourceful on the battlefield. Despite his notorious aggression, he knows when to time a quick spell to scrounge for gear, ammo, and patch up his men to keep the offensive going.”

              – Lieutenant Hayflick


            <style="Highlight">• ACTIVATE: 
              - Refill $1% of Special and Squad Weapon ammo, minimum $2.
              - Reduces <link="suppression">Suppression</link> by $3%.
              - Heals one <link="squaddies">Dummy</link>.</style>
            """
    }
    set "ShortDescription" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" "Refill Ammo, reduce Suppression, and heal a Dummy."
    }
}

patch "PerkTemplate" "perk.juiced" {
    set "Description" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" """
            “Kubra has turned her body into a mad chemist’s laboratory. Given her pursuits, it is our belief that she may have procured the first mixtures from a (REDACTED) barge, but suffice it to say her reaction to the injections were a little more controlled.”

              – SAGE Analysis


            <style="Highlight">• +$1 <link="hitpoints">HP</link> per <link="squaddies">Dummy</link>.</style>
            """
    }
    set "ShortDescription" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" "+$1 HP per Dummy."
    }
}

patch "PerkTemplate" "perk.jump_the_grenade" {
    set "Description" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" """
            “The Planetary Jingwei is a corrupt order within the Wayback, but it is not without its true believers.” 

              – Lieutenant Hayflick


            <style="Highlight">• Enemy AoE attacks can now only hit $1 <link="squaddies">Dummy</link>.
            </style>
            """
    }
    set "ShortDescription" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" "Enemy AoE attacks only hit $1 Dummy."
    }
}

patch "PerkTemplate" "perk.share_the_load" {
    set "Description" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" """
            “Due to agreements forged out of the Earth-Mars conflicts, Mars does not have legal access to the same planetary shaping technology as the rest of the Core Worlds. This has left Martians needing to constantly adapt to new locales. However, this biological malus has led to interesting methods of overcoming challenges particularly by way of communal effort. Some of these methods might even supersede textbook TCR approaches, if I am being honest.” 

              – Lieutenant Hayflick


            <style="Highlight">• Increase Special Weapon uses by $1 for each <link="squaddies">Dummy</link> up to $2%.</style>
            """
    }
    set "ShortDescription" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" "+$1 Special Weapon use for each Dummy up to $2%."
    }
}

