patch "SquaddieItemTemplate" "squaddie.recruitment_effort_small" {
    set "Description" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" "Recruit locals to join the fight aboard the Impetus. Add $1 <link=\"squaddies\">Dummies</link> to the manpower pool."
    }
}

patch "StrategicAssetTemplate" "civilian_clinic" {
    set "Description" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" """
            Local clinics aren’t exactly cutting edge health providers, but an on-spot MASH is vastly more efficient than achieving escape velocity to get back to the Imp.

            - Upon completion, increases the rescue chance for <link="squaddies">Dummies</link> by $1% for the rest of this operation.
            """
    }
    set "ShortDescription" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" "Upon completion, increases the rescue chance for <link=\"squaddies\">Dummies</link> by $1% for the rest of this operation."
    }
}

patch "StrategicAssetTemplate" "hearts_and_minds" {
    set "Description" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" """
            Whenever our friendly Marines complete a task, the first thing they should ask of the liberated locals: do you wish to know more? One would be surprised how often these first impressions lead to natives joining our cause.

            - Upon completion, gain $1 <link="squaddies">Dummies</link>.
            """
    }
    set "ShortDescription" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" "Upon completion, gain $1 <link=\"squaddies\">Dummies</link>."
    }
}

patch "StrategicAssetTemplate" "new_recruits" {
    set "Description" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" """
            The elements rescued from captivity offered to join our effort in the wayback. We welcome them on board!

            - Gain $1 additional <link="squaddies">Dummies</link>.
            """
    }
    set "ShortDescription" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" "Gain $1 additional <link=\"squaddies\">Dummies</link>."
    }
}

patch "StrategicAssetTemplate" "secured_infrastruct" {
    set "Description" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" """
            The relieved local force outpost provides a critical logistical advantage, serving as a staging node for planetary resupply routes throughout the remainder of the operation.

            - Upon completion, increases  <link="supply_cost">supplies</link> by $1%. and increases the rescue chance for <link="squaddies">Dummies</link> by $2% for the rest of this operation.
            """
    }
    set "ShortDescription" {
        set "m_DefaultTranslation" "Upon completion, increases  <link=\"supply_cost\">supplies</link> by $1%. and increases the rescue chance for <link=\"squaddies\">Dummies</link> by $2% for the rest of this operation."
    }
}

